I've got something coming up with Abena and I've completely lost track of it, so when is my Abena thing again?\"], [\"Could you tell me when my Abena thing is, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w08-0005\", \"v\": [[\"Abena stuff?\", \"phoned the second one, log it\", \"when'd we last talk?\", \"what else is on during Keswick?\", \"Keswick one an hour later\"], [\"I feel like there's a bunch of things going on with Abena at the moment, so can you pull up everything I've got for her?\", \"Oh, I actually rang the second one earlier today, so could you log that call for me so I don't forget I did it?\", \"Now I'm curious, because it feels like ages, when was the last time we actually spoke?\", \"Different thing, I'm starting to plan around my trip away, so what else is happening during the Keswick trip?\", \"I think I'll need a bit more time to get going that morning, so could you make the Keswick one an hour later?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w08-0006\", \"v\": [[\"I've been saving passwords all over the place lately and I've honestly lost count, so how many entries do I have in my locker now?\"], [\"Could you tell me how many entries I have in my password locker, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w08-0007\", \"v\": [[\"Could you show me my starred files, please?\", \"Sorry, hang on a moment — could you tell me which steps of the weigh flaisis's melon job are still open?\", \"Thank you. Going back to the starred documents, would you please star the fourth one?\"], [\"starred files\", \"hang on — weigh flaisis's melon job, what's open?\", \"back to starred docs — star the fourth\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w08-0008\", \"v\": [[\"Would you mind finding the pictures with Kavitha Aguilar in them, please?\", \"Actually, please don't worry about it, thank you.\"], [\"umm can you pull up the photos that have Kavitha Aguilar in them?\", \"oh, uh, actually no, don't bother, it's fine\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w08-0009\", \"v\": [[\"what have i got filed under Dordogne flat\", \"which of those r about the invoice\", \"also which expenses r in the number 37 house group\"], [\"ok so umm what've I got filed under Dordogne flat?\", \"and uh, which of those ones are about the invoice?\", \"oh and, different thing, what expenses are in the, um, the number 37 house group?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w08-0011\", \"v\": [[\"umm can you, uh, put back the wardrobe task I deleted?\"], [\"I think I got a bit delete-happy earlier and binned the wardrobe task by mistake, and I still need to do it, so could you bring it back?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w08-0012\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me whether I have any photos of Lonwyn, please?\", \"Thank you. Would you add a task to check the above photo on friday, please?\", \"Also, could you check whether I have anything on Weria in my notes?\", \"Sorry, hang on a moment — am I behind on any of my tasks?\", \"Going back to the notes from before, would you please delete both of them?\", \"Thank you. Could you tell me what's on my to-do list now?\"], [\"My cousin was asking about a picture from a while back, so do I have any photos of Lonwyn at all?\", \"I want to double-check who's in it before I send it on, so can you make me a task to check the above photo on friday?\", \"Different thing, I'm seeing Weria soon and I'm sure I jotted stuff down, so is there anything about Weria in my notes?\", \"Hang on, quick one while I think of it, I've got a nagging feeling I'm slipping, am I late on any tasks?\", \"Right, back to those notes from before, I've already dealt with all of that, so just delete both of them.\", \"Okay, now that's cleared out, what's left on my to-do list?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w08-0013\", \"v\": [[\"so umm, Vipuhaven… how much have I, uh, spent there in total?\"], [\"Vipuhaven - how much have i spent there so far\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w08-0014\", \"v\": [[\"umm what did I, uh, spend money on in Vipuhaven?\", \"ok, different thing, what've I got on, um, the 20th?\", \"and, uh, friday?\", \"ok can you, um, move both of those to next friday?\"], [\"I'm trying to reconcile the trip costs with everyone, so can you show me what I spent on in Vipuhaven?\", \"Okay, switching gears, I'm planning out the next few days, so what have I got on the 20th?\", \"Right, and what about friday, what's happening then?\", \"That day's looking way too full to me, so could you shift both of those to next friday instead?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w08-0016\", \"v\": [[\"Could you please bump the Macarena two hours later?\"], [\"I'm not going to make it back in time for the original slot, so could you bump the Macarena two hours later for me?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w08-0017\", \"v\": [[\"I was out and about quite a bit and snapped a few things, so can you show me the photos I took last weekend?\", \"Oh, that one's actually from drumming, so could you put it in the Taiko class album?\"], [\"Could you show me the photos I took last weekend, please?\", \"Thank you. Would you mind adding it to the Taiko class album, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w08-0018\", \"v\": [[\"I've fronted a lot of money for people lately and I've lost track, so does anyone still owe me cash?\", \"Different thing, I'm trying to settle up after the trip, so where do I stand with Akira in Vipuhaven?\", \"Oh and totally separate, I want to put together a little slideshow, so can you show me the photos I took last month?\"], [\"anyone owe me cash?\", \"me and Akira in Vipuhaven?\", \"photos from last month\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w08-0019\", \"v\": [[\"We've been splitting costs for the drums for ages and I've got no idea of the total, so for the gamelan syndicate, how much have I spent?\", \"Hang on, quick one before I forget, I'm trying to plan ahead, so what have I got next friday?\", \"Different thing, something came up and I need to shift plans, so could you push the Vipuhaven back a day?\", \"I'll need to let everyone know about the change, so who's actually coming to it?\", \"Oh and separately, I want to send some shots to the family, so what pictures do I have from this month?\", \"Actually, you know what, I'll sort that out later, so don't bother.\"], [\"umm so for the gamelan syndicate… how much have I, uh, spent?\", \"oh wait, hang on, what've I got on next friday?\", \"ok and, um, can you push the Vipuhaven back a day?\", \"and uh, who's coming to it?\", \"oh and, um, what pictures have I got from this month?\", \"actually no, uh, don't bother\"]]}","ttft_ms":19231,"type":"result","duration_ms":40681,"uuid":"1c836c22-3629-4d57-acb8-4abbffe99ffe","ttft_stream_ms":1513,"time_to_request_ms":150,"first_content_frame_ms":1513,"time_to_request_from_spawn_ms":21933106,"warm_spare_claimed":false,"time_origin_ms":1790278483726.256,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
